{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.nichika.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "店员说经理在后场叫你",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.nichika.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.nichika.first",
    "idolId": "nichika",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……这家店的自家特辑，做得真用力。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……店里这么上心，我也得加把劲了──",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──那个！你是 283 的人吧……！一直受您照顾了。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──啊，是楼层的负责人吧……！一直受你照顾。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "是、是的！那个，经理说想请您过去一下……能请您到后台来吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……诶，我刚刚才跟经理打过招呼──",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──有、有件事忘了跟您说……那个，这边请……！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──呃，那个……后台是走这边吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？那个……不好意思──",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──拜托您了！三分钟就好，请给我一点时间……！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "说谎了对不起……！我，是想当偶像的人──",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "想请您看看我的歌和舞……！拜托您了──！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……诶，那个，你──！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──怎么说呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "看着像是照着学的……自己摸索的，很外行……很平凡。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但是，那份喜欢偶像的憧憬和拼命，全都写在里面了──",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──怎、怎么样……！能进 283 吗！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──诶……啊……嗯，怎么说呢…………",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "拜托您！什么我都会做！您一定觉得我就是个平凡的高中生吧──",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──等等……！冷静一点……！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──我、我要喊人了哦……！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你、你这孩子……！这种事──",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个，就算你威胁我……现在能说的也不会变。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不好好测试一次，我什么都说不了。可以的话，找个正经的地方重新──",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "真、真的吗！那────",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，能不能收你，要看测试结果……！──能告诉我名字和联系方式吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──那……名字是…………",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "八云……ななみ。联系方式……请打这个号码！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……诶，八云……小姐？胸牌上写的是『七草』──",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "──────！诶、那个，这是──",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "nichika",
        "text": "…………被、被反对了……！姐姐那边，请保密────！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
